            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "These are the artifacts describing snippets. It seems that LSP server provides that entry described as \"Function fr...\", but it should be described as \"Snippet\" (or I have an outdated knowledge of LSP specification). This seems similar to #193.\r\n\r\nOne downside of 'mini.completion' is that it (maybe yet) doesn't support expanding LSP snippets. And it probably never will. I think that most people are using only a handful of snippets which are better off with setting up manually.  #180 has some good advice on this.\r\n\r\nI'll close it as similar to #193.\r\n\r\nThanks for trying out 'mini.completion'. Hope you'll stay for it or other modules :)",
